WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.800
Juri jumps as Ryu falls from heavy Fuhajin.

2
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:01.400
Jumping heavy kick reaches Ryu’s wake-up guard.

3
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.400
Juri jumps again and starts the jumping-medium, heavy-punch and heavy-kick chain.

4
00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:03.400
Crouching light kick reaches Ryu’s low guard after landing.

5
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:04.600
The medium and light normals continue the blocked FSE sequence.

6
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:05.000
Forward medium kick supplies the overhead branch.

7
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:05.950
Light Fuhajin finishes the shown blocked pressure.
